--TEST--
a namespace segment offers the types the workspace index holds under it, labelled by the rest of the name so what is inserted resolves — `rule:ide/completion-offers-only-what-the-compiler-derived`
--FILE--
<?nvs
namespace App;
interface Greets {}
class User {}
App\<|>
--REQUEST--
completion
--EXPECT--
